From 5165cc08a663987dfa9921080fbaaefde1f6c28a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:51:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Serve stored media under /storage instead of /manus-storage

The API is on Railway now, but the media proxy and the URLs it writes still
carried the Manus path shape.

- Register the storage proxy at /storage/* and keep /manus-storage/* on the same
  handler, so URLs already persisted in the database keep resolving.
- storagePut/storageGet now return /storage/{key} for new uploads.
- Replace the manus.space fallback invite base URL with https://justputzit.com;
  invites were being generated against the retired Manus host.
- Update DEPLOY.md and the storage tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
